# Patches applied on all platforms. Upstream patches keep their upstream
# series order so hunks touching the same files apply cleanly. See UPSTREAM.md
# for why each upstream patch is taken or skipped.
#
#   ungoogled/<path>            - build/ungoogled-chromium/patches/<path>
#   ungoogled-<platform>/<path> - build/ungoogled-chromium-<platform>/patches/<path>
#   <path>                      - patches/<path> (ours)
#
# [sb]    Safe Browsing removal (safe_browsing_mode = 0), these go together.
# [flags] ungoogled chrome://flags block: off-by-default knobs. Each patch appends
#         to ungoogled_flag_entries.h after the previous one, so the block is
#         taken whole and in order (a subset needs local fixups).

